{
 "id": "synthetics-api-tests",
 "title": "Synthetics - API Test Performance",
 "description": "Response times, results and per-phase timings of synthetic API tests, from the synthetics.* metrics.",
 "kind": "integration",
 "logo": "tile:synthetics",
 "teams": [],
 "layoutType": "grid",
 "templateVariables": [
  {
   "name": "subtype",
   "prefix": "subtype",
   "default": "*"
  },
  {
   "name": "test_id",
   "prefix": "test_id",
   "default": "*"
  },
  {
   "name": "location",
   "prefix": "location",
   "default": "*"
  },
  {
   "name": "env",
   "prefix": "env",
   "default": "*"
  }
 ],
 "widgets": [
  {
   "id": "syn-1",
   "definition": {
    "type": "note",
    "content": "# API Test Performance\n\nResponse times, results and the timing of each phase of your synthetic API tests, from the `synthetics.*` metrics every scheduled run writes.\n\n- Narrow it down with the **subtype**, **test_id**, **location** and **env** variables above.\n- Every HTTP run splits its time into DNS, connection, TLS, time to first byte and download.\n- Clone this dashboard to rearrange it or add your own widgets.\n\n*No data?* [Create an API test](/synthetics/templates) to start monitoring.",
    "background": "white",
    "align": "left",
    "fontSize": "md"
   },
   "layout": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 6,
    "h": 8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "syn-2",
   "definition": {
    "type": "integration",
    "title": "Synthetic API test runs",
    "original": {
     "type": "query_value",
     "title": "Synthetic API test runs",
     "title_size": "16",
     "title_align": "left",
     "precision": 0,
     "requests": [
      {
       "response_format": "scalar",
       "queries": [
        {
         "data_source": "metrics",
         "name": "query1",
         "query": "sum:synthetics.test_runs{$subtype,$test_id,$location,$env}.as_count()",
         "aggregator": "sum"
        }
       ],
       "formulas": [
        {
         "formula": "query1"
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "custom_unit": "runs"
    }
   },
   "layout": {
    "x": 6,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 3,
    "h": 4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "syn-3",
   "definition": {
    "type": "integration",
    "title": "Synthetic API test success rate",
    "original": {
     "type": "query_value",
     "title": "Synthetic API test success rate",
     "title_size": "16",
     "title_align": "left",
     "precision": 2,
     "requests": [
      {
       "response_format": "scalar",
       "queries": [
        {
         "data_source": "metrics",
         "name": "query1",
         "query": "sum:synthetics.test_runs{result:passed,$subtype,$test_id,$location,$env}.as_count()",
         "aggregator": "sum"
        },
        {
         "data_source": "metrics",
         "name": "query2",
         "query": "sum:synthetics.test_runs{$subtype,$test_id,$location,$env}.as_count()",
         "aggregator": "sum"
        }
       ],
       "formulas": [
        {
         "formula": "100 * query1 / query2"
        }
       ],
       "conditional_formats": [
        {
         "comparator": ">=",
         "value": 99,
         "palette": "white_on_green"
        },
        {
         "comparator": ">=",
         "value": 95,
         "palette": "white_on_yellow"
        },
        {
         "comparator": "<",
         "value": 95,
         "palette": "white_on_red"
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "custom_unit": "%"
    }
   },
   "layout": {
    "x": 9,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 3,
    "h": 4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "syn-4",
   "definition": {
    "type": "integration",
    "title": "API test runs by type",
    "original": {
     "type": "sunburst",
     "title": "API test runs by type",
     "title_size": "16",
     "title_align": "left",
     "hide_total": false,
     "requests": [
      {
       "response_format": "scalar",
       "queries": [
        {
         "data_source": "metrics",
         "name": "query1",
         "query": "sum:synthetics.test_runs{$subtype,$test_id,$location,$env} by {subtype}.as_count()",
         "aggregator": "sum"
        }
       ],
       "formulas": [
        {
         "formula": "query1"
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "legend": {
      "type": "automatic"
